        "content": "<p>Today I chose issue <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/26018\">#26018</a> for discussion!</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/issues/26018\">Kernel type checking performance depends on lexicographic ordering of universe variables</a></strong><br>\nCreated by <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"648495\">@Christian Merten</span> (@chrisflav) on 2025-06-17<br>\nLabels: </p>\n<p>Is this issue still relevant? Any recent updates? Anyone making progress?</p>",
