    {
        "content": "<p>The issue still just about exists, however it is far less serious than before. </p>\n<p>Example: the change from <code>variable (R : Type u)</code> to <code>variable (R : Type v)</code> in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/34088\">#34088</a> (which used to have a huge effect) now has a far less marked effect. It's still true that kernel typechecking becomes 30x faster, but elaboration is now pretty much the same, and kernel typechecking is now fairly quick. Here is a comparison of what the universe name change does to timings of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=KaehlerDifferential.mvPolynomialEquiv#doc\">docs#KaehlerDifferential.mvPolynomialEquiv</a> now:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">):</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">26926582.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">definition</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">25758182.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvPolynomialEquiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▶</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">5578796.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">private</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AddDecl</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addDeclCore</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Kernel</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">5578745.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typechecking</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declarations</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvPolynomialEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">._</span><span class=\"n\">proof_2</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">5601809.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">private</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AddDecl</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addDeclCore</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Kernel</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">5601744.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typechecking</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declarations</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvPolynomialEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">._</span><span class=\"n\">proof_1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">):</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">25116436.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">definition</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">23982478.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvPolynomialEquiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▶</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">184909.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">private</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AddDecl</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addDeclCore</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Kernel</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">184858.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typechecking</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declarations</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvPolynomialEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">._</span><span class=\"n\">proof_2</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">274123.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">private</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AddDecl</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addDeclCore</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Kernel</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">274076.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">✅️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typechecking</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declarations</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvPolynomialEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">._</span><span class=\"n\">proof_1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">-/</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Note: it is also still true that I cannot minimise this to give a mathlib-free example of the 30x speedup in kernel typechecking. Doing it manually is horrible. Using the mathlib-minimiser: I gave up after several months because core had changed and the issue I was tracking changed with it. Finally asking an LLM to do it -- it told me that it was impossible.</p>",
